@startuml deployment
!pragma layout smetana
title Deployment Diagram - Moderated LMS v1.x (single school computer, offline)

node "School computer\n<<device>>\nWindows 10/11 x64 (or Ubuntu 22.04+)\n>= 2 GB RAM, dual-core" as PC {
  node "Operating system\n<<execution environment>>" as OS {
    artifact "lms.exe\n(statically linked:\nlms_core, lms_ui, SQLite 3.46,\nArgon2 reference)" as EXE
    artifact "lms.db\n(SQLite database, WAL mode)" as DB
    artifact "lms.db-wal / lms.db-shm" as WAL
    artifact "doc/\n(installation guide, user manuals,\nrelease notes)" as DOCS
  }
  folder "Backup folder / USB drive\n(daily copy of lms.db)" as BK
}

actor "Staff and students\n(one at a time, at the keyboard)" as Users

Users --> EXE : console session
EXE --> DB : reads / writes\n(SQLite C API, file locking)
DB .. WAL
DB ..> BK : scheduled copy\n(technician task)

note right of PC
  No network connection is required (NFR-09).
  All four roles use the same executable; the
  role is decided at login. Users log out so
  the next person can log in.
end note
@enduml
